  "instance_name": "welfare_dependency_tropes",
  "label": "Welfare Dependency Tropes",
  "description": "A set of derogatory stereotypes that portray individuals receiving public assistance as lazy, irresponsible, or morally deficient. These tropes are often used to justify cuts to social programs or to shame recipients. In this meme, the text 'more than 50 cents a day' implies the person is receiving welfare or government aid, and the image is used to mock or stigmatize them based on their appearance and assumed economic behavior.",
